<title>JAPAN: Key TIFFE Euroyen futures steady at Tokyo close.</title>
<headline>Key TIFFE Euroyen futures steady at Tokyo close.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key September Euroyen contract on TIFFE was steady at the close of Tokyo's day session on Wednesday, with traders reluctant to make fresh positions due to a lack of new incentives.</p>
<p>The market is waiting for the scheduled appearance of Eisuke Sakakibara, director-general of the Finance Ministry's International Finance Bureau, on a local television programme on Thursday.</p>
</text>
